# 2D test source for X-Y reconstruction validation.
# 4 GPS point sources at Z=0, placed at known (X,Y) positions inside tissue.
# Being point sources at Z=0 they have zero Z extent -- every emitted photon
# originates at exactly that (X,Y) in the reconstruction plane.
# After MLEM you should see 4 distinct peaks at:
#   src0: ( 0,  0) mm -- centre of body
#   src1: (+6, +10) mm -- upper right torso
#   src2: (-6, +10) mm -- upper left torso
#   src3: ( 0, +20) mm -- upper torso midline
# If any peak is missing or displaced, that directly pinpoints where the
# system matrix or pipeline has a problem.
#
# All 4 positions verified inside non-air tissue at the central Z slice.
# Equal activity per source so all 4 peaks should appear equally bright.

/gate/source/addSource src0 gps
/gate/source/src0/gps/particle gamma
/gate/source/src0/gps/ene/type Mono
/gate/source/src0/gps/ene/mono 140.0 keV
/gate/source/src0/gps/pos/type Point
/gate/source/src0/gps/pos/centre 0. 0. 0. mm
/gate/source/src0/gps/ang/type iso
/gate/source/src0/setActivity 0.000025 Ci

/gate/source/addSource src1 gps
/gate/source/src1/gps/particle gamma
/gate/source/src1/gps/ene/type Mono
/gate/source/src1/gps/ene/mono 140.0 keV
/gate/source/src1/gps/pos/type Point
/gate/source/src1/gps/pos/centre 6. 10. 0. mm
/gate/source/src1/gps/ang/type iso
/gate/source/src1/setActivity 0.000025 Ci

/gate/source/addSource src2 gps
/gate/source/src2/gps/particle gamma
/gate/source/src2/gps/ene/type Mono
/gate/source/src2/gps/ene/mono 140.0 keV
/gate/source/src2/gps/pos/type Point
/gate/source/src2/gps/pos/centre -6. 10. 0. mm
/gate/source/src2/gps/ang/type iso
/gate/source/src2/setActivity 0.000025 Ci

/gate/source/addSource src3 gps
/gate/source/src3/gps/particle gamma
/gate/source/src3/gps/ene/type Mono
/gate/source/src3/gps/ene/mono 140.0 keV
/gate/source/src3/gps/pos/type Point
/gate/source/src3/gps/pos/centre 0. 20. 0. mm
/gate/source/src3/gps/ang/type iso
/gate/source/src3/setActivity 0.000025 Ci

/gate/source/list